      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5c3d88ea458a806c41784b8b|full_name}: Neither person can see each other. I was referring to the person being blocked still wanting to see them. Blocking should only affect the person doing it, not the person being blocked. Maybe have it turn their nametag a different color.",
